re; automated clearing house transactions; and traditional commercial and industrial, and commercial real estate products, such as lines of credit, term loans, and construction loans. The Virgin Islands Operations segment focuses on consumer and commercial lending, and deposit-taking activities. The company also offers automobile financing and insurance agency services. First BanCorp. was founded in 1948 and is headquartered in San Juan, Puerto Rico.","employees":3218,"website":"https://www.1firstbank.com","country":"United States","city":"San Juan","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Aurelio  Aleman-Bermudez","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Juan Carlos Pavia","title":"Executive VP & COO"},{"name":"Ms. Nayda  Rivera-Batista CPA","title":"Executive VP, Corporate Chief of Staff & Chief Consumer Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.73,"tpe":12.65,"ps":3.475,"pfcf":11.37,"peg":1.3,"pb":1.602,"ev_ebitda":11.13,"rev_growth":0.088,"eps_growth":0.119,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1342,"eps_growth_next":0.1037,"div_yield":0.0224,"roe":0.1286,"roa":0.01545,"de":54.23,"gross_margin":0.2385,"op_margin":0.3722,"profit_margin":0.2554,"current_ratio":1.499},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":10.49,"sector":10.73,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":11.0,"sector":12.65,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":4.039,"sector":3.475,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":11.37,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":4.15,"sector":1.3,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":2.094,"sector":1.602,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":null,"sector":54.23,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.062,"sector":0.088,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0,"sector":0.119,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.1907,"sector":0.1342,"verdi